# Z3ST: An open-source FEniCSx framework for thermo-mechanical analysis
# Author: Giovanni Zullo
# Version: 0.3.0 (2026)
# --.. ..- .-.. .-.. --- --.. ..- .-.. .-.. --- --.. ..- .-.. .-.. ---

# --. IDE / editor / assistant files --..
.vscode/
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/*.md
CLAUDE.md
punch_list.md

# --. Python --..
__pycache__/
z3st.egg-info

# --. Compilation objects --..
build/
cache/

# --. Batch and temporary scripts --..
*.batch

# --. Log and JSON files --..
log.*
*.log
non-regression.json

# --. Per-case run summaries produced by the thermal-conductivity comparisons --..
case_summary.json
conductivity_impact.json
comparison_summary.json
fit_metrics.json
z3st/cases/**/log_*.md
!z3st/cases/verification/mechanics/uniaxial_tension/log_*.md
input_check.txt

# --. Data / results / figures --..
*.csv
*.png
*.pdf

# --. Mesh and simulation outputs --..
*.msh
*.h5
*.xdmf
*.vtu
energies.txt

# --. Trained model weights and fitted checkpoints --..
# Both are regenerated before every run by the owning case (train_knet.py,
# make_synthetic_gpr.py), so no binary artefact is tracked.
*.pt
*.npz

# --. LaTeX build artifacts (slides.pdf is force-tracked) --..
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.nav
*.out
*.snm
*.toc
*.vrb
*.synctex.gz
*.bbl
*.blg
force_displacement.txt
